  <!-- EN: psyflux projection chip -->
  <APM_PsyfluxChip.label>chip de proyección de psiflujo</APM_PsyfluxChip.label>
  <!-- EN: A perception-warping mechanoid micro-organ that regulates rapid displacement, charged-particle emissions, and brief periods of psychic imperceptibility. It is necessary to produce certain advanced types of mechanoids and equipment. A mechanitor can study this chip to help unlock higher tiers of mechtech research. -->
